    <string name="about_text">Free OBD2 diagnostics. No subscription, no ads, no accounts, no internet connection. All data stays on your phone.</string>
    <string name="about_limits_title">What generic OBD2 can do</string>
    <string name="about_safety">The app only reads data. The only command that changes anything in the car is \"Clear codes\" (Mode 04), which always asks you twice. It never writes to, codes or tunes the car computers.</string>

